1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,651
Distill separates the transferable
principle from the local implementation.

2
00:00:04,721 --> 00:00:09,393
Ask which conditions made the intervention
useful and which conditions limited it.

3
00:00:09,463 --> 00:00:14,860
A reusable pattern names those conditions,
the mechanism, and the evidence boundary.

4
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:19,346
Copying the entire previous architecture
creates an imperial playbook.

5
00:00:19,416 --> 00:00:25,112
A principle becomes more useful when another
site can test it without inheriting assumptions

6
00:00:25,182 --> 00:00:27,934
that belonged only to the original environment.

7
00:00:28,004 --> 00:00:31,609
Northstar benefited from
reviewable category suggestions.

8
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:34,965
A warehouse needs exception
handling, not support queues.

9
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:41,307
The reusable idea is embedding a reviewable
suggestion in the existing decision step, while

10
00:00:41,377 --> 00:00:43,531
the category rule remains local.

11
00:00:43,601 --> 00:00:48,380
Pause the video and complete this exercise
before opening the worked response.

12
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:53,805
Write one conditional pattern and name two
conditions that require retesting elsewhere.

13
00:00:53,875 --> 00:00:59,891
When repetitive classification consumes effort
and operators retain decision authority, a

14
00:00:59,961 --> 00:01:04,398
suggestion embedded in the existing
review step may reduce lookup work.

15
00:01:04,468 --> 00:01:08,735
Retest category stability and
operator incentives at the new site.

16
00:01:08,805 --> 00:01:15,226
The course evidence supports this as a hypothesis
for transfer, not a universal rule about AI

17
00:01:15,296 --> 00:01:16,363
deployment.

18
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,990
What should transfer first?

19
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:20,961
A. Every service from the old architecture B.

20
00:01:21,031 --> 00:01:23,165
The principle and its conditions C.

21
00:01:23,235 --> 00:01:25,048
The old customer’s permissions.

22
00:01:25,118 --> 00:01:26,590
The best answer is B.

23
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:29,668
Transfer the mechanism while rechecking context.
